t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">$16/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$12/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$16/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.4.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Limestone</b> is one of the 6 ore-holding nodes that spawn on <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>. It only spawns in the Oke desert.\n</p><p>Raw limestone uses the new slate texture, and the new concrete texture when forged. It has the same texture and similar color as <a href=\"/wiki/Sandstone\" title=\"Sandstone\">sandstone</a>, albeit darker. This can cause confusion for an unexperienced player.\n</p><p>Notably, gold and rose gold have a higher chance to spawn in limestone due to less ores taking their place.\n</p><p>Requires atleast a <a href=\"/wiki/Metal_Refinery\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Metal Refinery\">Metal Refinery</a> to process it.\n</p>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_chart_below_displays_all_possible_ores_that_spawn_within_this_node.\">The chart below displays all possible ores that spawn within this node.</span></h5>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/Gold1.png/revision/latest?cb=20230124105142\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Gold1\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gold1.png\" data-image-key=\"Gold1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/Gold1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20230124105142\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/02/Rose_gold.png/revision/latest?cb=20230710190648\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Rose gold\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Rose gold.png\" data-image-key=\"Rose_gold.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/02/Rose_gold.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20230710190648\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Rose_Gold\" title=\"Rose